{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-19","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例与整数","englishTitle":"Between two similar solid numbers there fall two mean proportional numbers; and the solid number has to the similar solid number the ratio triplicate of that which the corresponding side has to the corresponding side.","book":8,"number":19,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.19","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.19/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":19,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","contentId":"euclid-8-19","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c44e1e3f0fcee52d1d20077c28406c2a3f82ddd40d1de38f7746421cadf7b40","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-19.statement","euclid-8-19.construction.1","euclid-8-19.proof.1","euclid-8-19.proof.2","euclid-8-19.construction.2","euclid-8-19.proof.3","euclid-8-19.construction.3","euclid-8-19.proof.4","euclid-8-19.proof.5","euclid-8-19.proof.6","euclid-8-19.proof.7","euclid-8-19.proof.8","euclid-8-19.proof.9","euclid-8-19.proof.10","euclid-8-19.proof.11","euclid-8-19.proof.12","euclid-8-19.proof.13","euclid-8-19.proof.14","euclid-8-19.proof.15","euclid-8-19.proof.16","euclid-8-19.proof.17","euclid-8-19.proof.18","euclid-8-19.proof.19","euclid-8-19.proof.20","euclid-8-19.proof.21","euclid-8-19.proof.22","euclid-8-19.proof.23","euclid-8-19.proof.24","euclid-8-19.proof.25","euclid-8-19.conclusion","euclid-8-19.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-19.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb0729502bab564fdf4a2019e46879d3a1b4e76dd623273c7b6bec68524c9e49","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Between two similar solid numbers there fall two mean proportional numbers; and the solid number has to the similar solid number the ratio triplicate of that which the corresponding side has to the corresponding side."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在2 相似立体数之间,有2 比例中项个数字;立体数个数字与相似立体数个数字的比是3倍,对应方与对应方的比是3倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ee0fd786bfa6c8f8e05916900ffc126b382f7bc4911aef7b12815c5c8d0b1ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be two similar solid numbers, and let C, D, E be the sides of A, and F, G, H of B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B成为2 相似立体数,让C,D,E成为A的两边,B的F,G,H成为B的两边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39c64ddc73ad51120d688b4716953ffcd57913de0c7f397135918d3204276eec","citations":["euclid-7-def-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since similar solid numbers are those which have their sides proportional, [[VII. Def. 21](/principles/euclid-7-def-21)] therefore, as C is to D, so is F to G, and, as D is to E, so is G to H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于相似立体数是那些有其侧面成比例的人,因此,C对D的比等于F对G的比,D对E的比等于G对H的比；C 与 D 之比等于 F 与 G 之比；D 与 E 之比等于 G 与 H 之比。 [[VII. Def. 21](/principles/euclid-7-def-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3eea8d0bd3bb566736c464f7678176cdd465c723fda17deb38ab8b9526ee8d61","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that between A, B there fall two mean proportional numbers, and A has to B the ratio triplicate of that which C has to F, D to G, and also E to H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,在A、B之间,有2 比例中项个数字,A数字比C数字的三倍,C数字比为F,D数字比为G,还有E数字比为H。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"46581f4bded107a97b63519a1a6d6085e1b6ec51878110c8015a9adf2fe53901","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let C by multiplying D make K, and let F by multiplying G make L."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C和D的产物是K,F和G的产物是L。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"95f3a3f6d9100802657248ccc4b5f7218191b4cdd21f6e75c78ec1882f3d77c2","citations":["euclid-7-def-21","euclid-8-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since C, D are in the same ratio with F, G, and K is the product of C, D, and L the product of F, G, K, L are similar plane numbers; [[VII. Def. 21](/principles/euclid-7-def-21)] therefore between K, L there is one mean proportional number. [[VIII. 18](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为 C 与 D 之比等于 F 与 G 之比，K 是 C 与 D 的乘积，L 是 F 与 G 的乘积，所以 K 与 L 是相似平面数；因此，在 K 与 L 之间存在一个比例中项。 [[VII. Def. 21](/principles/euclid-7-def-21)] [[VIII. 18](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"acc00ced5962558b49cb08bdf90200641f3e85ec4eeab3ad6f71b345993af48f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be M"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"M块"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9cc4445d950e3787fdd9ca3ef91983811a18c742913a9e58392e84fff83a82a1","citations":["euclid-8-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore M is the product of D, F, as was proved in the theorem preceding this. [[VIII. 18](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,M是D,F的产物,前述理论就证明了这一点。 [[VIII. 18](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5984da98be371550f5601ab113f291d7d047fdb321f67953d13349816f4ca574","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since D by multiplying C has made K, and by multiplying F has made M, therefore, as C is to F, so is K to M. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,D乘以C, 已经达到K, F乘以M, C比F等于K比M；C 与 F 之比等于 K 与 M 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c74983b475b92688b39b376bc91461c7929267e805d39ada3b0e6a7538ca4db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as K is to M, so is M to L."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,K比M的比等于M比L；K 与 M 之比等于 M 与 L 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c264e60be0d1ce5ba1f894a9b360c223e2892c6d36c2c44c1659767f324ea052","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore K, M, L are continuously proportional in the ratio of C to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,K,M,L持续为成比例,比例为C与F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e760df80cbc6c2aab7b8087b475c9c3e12eabfafddc18d29c14aefe94c341e4","citations":["euclid-7-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as C is to D, so is F to G, alternately therefore, as C is to F, so is D to G. [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C对D的比等于F对G的比,C对F的比等于D对G的比；C 与 D 之比等于 F 与 G 之比；C 与 F 之比等于 D 与 G 之比。 [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1952e14a3396e85216ca454b77bdeee5204aade4583670e0e3d4b64aff09b18a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also, as D is to G, so is E to H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,D比G的比例等于E比H；D 与 G 之比等于 E 与 H 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"15828db3f31385695be9152fedee123820b2325ffecb3edf24a263e7c259c39e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore K, M, L are continuously proportional in the ratio of C to F, in the ratio of D to G, and also in the ratio of E to H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,K,M,L继续为成比例,即C与F的比,D与G的比,E与H的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a4aea9a18ad5c98ed4d895c140adc8953ac76807c2c9ab83a06c8f1a4d815ae0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let E, H by multiplying M make N, O respectively."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,E,H乘以M 分别是N,O"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9501e032af91340a08d0d98e832aad684253836df98480cee6a79ab6fd6a63e5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since A is a solid number, and C, D, E are its sides, therefore E by multiplying the product of C, D has made A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,A是立体数,C,D,E是它的两面,因此E乘以C,D的产物,就创造了A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cec630b03521b63d1f478e19cef4b3bba5805cc6425b95a42fb50a4d41645df0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the product of C, D is K; therefore E by multiplying K has made A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但C,D的产物是K,E乘以K, 已经生产了A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c09d960042aacf1389844e706edf7e831f1b84c9c0d1acdbbd0fc1a133f752da","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also H by multiplying L has made B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,H乘以L, 已经做了B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4c82d7348f468dc5e02ff7e6ac49c3edae8bb22c5d29faaf8e17029485f4a0f2","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since E by multiplying K has made A, and further also by multiplying M has made N, therefore, as K is to M, so is A to N. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,E乘以K, 已经达到A, M乘以N, 因此,K比M等于A比N；K 与 M 之比等于 A 与 N 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b199bbc6b3d331ff750f7d42a349b9dcdb8cfda8ac57fcfe41f039651c4e95e0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as K is to M, so is C to F, D to G, and also E to H; therefore also, as C is to F, D to G, and E to H, so is A to N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,K对M的比等于C对F,D对G,还有E对H;因此,C对F,D对G,E对H,E对H,A对N；K 与 M 之比等于 C 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8d352439cb220071f75367c4f0b408659094c952e058d2fb393e09ad52a5202","citations":["euclid-7-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since E, H by multiplying M have made N, O respectively, therefore, as E is to H, so is N to O. [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自EH乘以MO,分别达到NOEH,即等于NO7月7日H7月7日N次O次H次7；E 与 H 之比等于 N 与 O 之比。 [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4976a37db1665382fdb9c7a07315a2d050da4361f03936677501c8bbcc92b358","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as E is to H, so is C to F and D to G; therefore also, as C is to F, D to G, and E to H, so is A to N and N to O."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,E对H的比等于C对F和D对G的比;因此,C对F、D对G和E对H的比也等于A对N和N对O的比；E 与 H 之比等于 C 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"964a96d70dc841e7d10d5693066fc7e6cf468601210045006dd2a7a14c2227d5","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since H by multiplying M has made O, and further also by multiplying L has made B, therefore, as M is to L, so is O to B. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自H乘以M后,O成为O,L成为B,M与L的比等于O与B；M 与 L 之比等于 O 与 B 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6468ff8fdcbcc53720991354304ba22f9210e80e01f8f4f0bf6c66a8ae354500","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as M is to L, so is C to F, D to G, and E to H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,M对L的比等于C对F、D对G和E对H的比；M 与 L 之比等于 C 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4de14af924a4336fa0814f9cca6b0f2b396b11a4eeb2d44dc770ab591602b3a4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as C is to F, D to G, and E to H, so not only is O to B, but also A to N and N to O."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此，C 与 F、D 与 G、E 与 H 的比彼此相等，而且都等于 O 与 B、A 与 N 以及 N 与 O 的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"648b854e54f44561b28a1fb3322be9b4dffd116e246e0635ad06e407291a22bc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, N, O, B are continuously proportional in the aforesaid ratios of the sides."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,按照双方上述比,A、N、O、B持续为成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8bac9f5abfb5c9a68cf3b9c6734878611bfbc7f5fa574293d75bbe1d2676cc2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that A also has to B the ratio triplicate of that which the corresponding side has to the corresponding side, that is, of the ratio which the number C has to F, or D to G, and also E to H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,A比例的三倍是对应方与对应方的三倍,即C比例为F,即D比例为G比例,还有E比例为H比例。（相关点与线段：B）"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e9770d172222d99c8473c663d9926da762834c766b06b026046d315c173b7cfe","citations":["euclid-5-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A, N, O, B are four numbers in continued proportion, therefore A has to B the ratio triplicate of that which A has to N. [[V. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-5-def-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A以来,N,O,B是连比例的4个数字,因此A比B的比是A比N的三倍。 [[V. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-5-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"19a700f0471d406fc776b790b445bf525cffeac292fa2938b0ec8f499116e66b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as A is to N, so it was proved that C is to F, D to G, and also E to H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是已经证明，A 与 N 之比等于 C 与 F、D 与 G 以及 E 与 H 的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":29,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"65ecf81ca40856abeea2ba24db42e40a4b9ff0ff69b5587c88f657b78a383a6e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A also has to B the ratio triplicate of that which the corresponding side has to the corresponding side, that is, of the ratio which the number C has to F, D to G, and also E to H. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比例的三倍数也达到B,即C比例为F,D为G,还有E为H。 Q为E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-19.source","contentId":"euclid-8-19","revisionId":"euclid-8-19@raw-1c44e1e3f0fcee52","order":30,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c3d1fdf79456012f35c20895d8f7b4080159dd87f78d0283be69bf1cdac35d7c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata"